{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 15:31:39.785765", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network appears to be experiencing significant issues with reachability. Based on the ping results, all tested connections between hosts (clients, DNS servers, and web servers) are marked as \"unknown.\" This indicates that no successful communication or response was observed during the reachability tests.\\n\\n#### Observed Anomalies:\\n1. **Complete Lack of Reachability**:\\n   - All tested connections between hosts (e.g., `client_0` to `webserver0_pod0`, `dns_pod0` to `client_0`, etc.) show no transmitted or received packets (`tx` and `rx` are null).\\n   - No round-trip time (RTT) metrics are available, and the status for all tests is \"unknown.\"\\n\\n2. **Potential Routing or Connectivity Issues**:\\n   - The absence of any successful ping results suggests a possible issue with routing configurations, link failures, or misconfigured network devices.\\n\\n#### Relevant Findings:\\n- **Host IP Addresses**:\\n  - The IP addresses of the hosts are correctly assigned as per the network description:\\n    - `client_0`: 192.168.0.2\\n    - `client_1`: 192.168.1.2\\n    - `dns_pod0`: 10.0.0.2\\n    - `dns_pod1`: 10.1.0.2\\n    - Web servers are assigned IPs in their respective subnets (e.g., `webserver0_pod0`: 10.0.1.2, `webserver0_pod1`: 10.1.1.2).\\n  - This confirms that the IP addressing scheme aligns with the network design.\\n\\n- **Ping Results**:\\n  - All results are null, indicating no communication between the tested hosts.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nTo further diagnose the root cause of the issue, the following areas should be investigated:\\n1. **Routing Configuration**:\\n   - Verify BGP configurations on the routers to ensure proper advertisement and propagation of routes.\\n2. **Interface and Link Status**:\\n   - Check the status of interfaces and links on the routers and hosts to identify any physical or logical connectivity issues.\\n3. **Service Status**:\\n   - Confirm that essential services (e.g., DNS, HTTP servers) are running on the respective hosts.\\n4. **Network Device Logs**:\\n   - Review logs from routers and switches for any error messages or anomalies.\\n\\nThis report highlights the current state of the network and identifies areas requiring further investigation to pinpoint the root cause of the connectivity issues., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='476a1265-1227-42a1-ba36-3bbe2c495df1'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
